        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "\n// Single place that resolves the customer's message text and ids, whichever\n// branch produced it. Every later node reads from here.\nconst identify = $('Identify Customer').item.json;\nconst source = $('Split Messages').isExecuted\n  ? $('Split Messages').item.json\n  : $('Use Forwarded Message').item.json;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    text: source.message.text,\n    external_message_id: source.message.external_message_id,\n    channel_account_external_id: source.message.channel_account_external_id,\n    trace_id: source.trace_id,\n    tenant_id: identify.tenant.id,\n    customer_id: identify.customer.id,\n    customer_phone: identify.customer.phone,\n    conversation_id: identify.conversation.id,\n  },\n}];\n"
      },
